                        VOLKSWRITER   3   TUTORIAL 

                            Part 1 - The Basics

Welcome to the Volkswriter 3 tutorials.  We have provided these tutorials to
help you learn the pleasures of working with Volkswriter 3 quickly and
easily.

If you are experienced with personal computers, we suggest that you at least
skim through these tutorials for general information about Volkswriter 3.
You can also print the tutorial files, so you can refer to them later.

If you are familiar with earlier versions of Volkswriter or Volkswriter
Deluxe, refer to the "FEATURES" file on the same disk as this tutorial, and
to the separate instruction sheet with your manual.

We are nearing the bottom of the screen now.  Here is how to see more...

